<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Install Slipzo Mobile App</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .card { background: white; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 2rem; max-width: 420px; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    h2 { margin-top: 0; color: #0284c7; }
    ol { text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; color: #334155; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #0ea5e9; color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 1rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>📱 Install Slipzo App</h2>
    <p>Installing via Google WebAPK is official & secure without package parsing errors!</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open Slipzo in Chrome mobile browser.</li>
      <li>Tap the <strong>3 dots (⋮)</strong> menu at top right.</li>
      <li>Select <strong>"Install app"</strong> or <strong>"Add to Home Screen"</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
    <a href="/" class="btn">Open Slipzo App</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
